    "public_message": "Round 1 results show that coordinated contributions of 15 tokens yielded a solid 24.2 payoff for contributors. The 1.6 multiplier works best when everyone participates meaningfully. I'd like to see us all contribute at a high level again in Round 2 — perhaps 15-18 tokens each. This maximizes the multiplier effect and benefits everyone. Let's coordinate to make Round 2 a strong collaborative round!",
